From: VLC Redesign
Subject: [PATCH] mkspecs: do not link AGL on macOS

The macOS 26 SDK no longer has AGL.framework, and nothing needs it.
---
--- a/mkspecs/common/mac.conf	2026-11-10 00:30:32.774539808 +1300
+++ b/mkspecs/common/mac.conf	2026-11-10 00:30:32.776241466 +1300
@@ -30,7 +30,7 @@
 QMAKE_REL_RPATH_BASE    = @loader_path
 
 QMAKE_LIBS_DYNLOAD      =
-QMAKE_LIBS_OPENGL       = -framework OpenGL -framework AGL
+QMAKE_LIBS_OPENGL       = -framework OpenGL
 QMAKE_LIBS_THREAD       =
 
 QMAKE_INCDIR_WAYLAND    =
